Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.29,0:00:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.93,0:00:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你参战了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you go to war,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.65,0:00:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,必将遭受可怕的不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are destined for great and unfortunate things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我将拔营北进 向阿尔卑斯山进军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would press north, towards the Alps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们的人四散而去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's see our people to the winds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以从南边进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We could press attack from the South.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,庞培可以阻止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pompey could stay Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯遁入山中逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from gaining the mountains and slipping from grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,下次我就不会这么温柔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not be as gentle next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她跑到叛贼的队伍里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has moved to join rebellion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,拿提比略的性命来换五百条人命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Five hundred of your men for Tiberius' life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这小子毫无价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy holds no value now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏会如约交易的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus will yet honor trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,只要他得到另一样他所渴望的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you give him something else his heart desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,准备行军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Prepare the men for march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我要大举进攻斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would press towards Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,要他死无葬身之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see him to deserved end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：诅咒者之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,《伟大胜利》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,带话给你这样的奴隶主 立刻释放奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spread word to your kind to strike shackle from their slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,否则他们的宅子就跟你的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or see their houses follow yours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,遍地鲜血和死尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in blood and death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,又一座宅子遭袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Another villa set upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.21,0:02:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,总共有几座了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What number holds total?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这几天来 就有六座了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Six in half as many days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,其袭击之迅猛 堪比战神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He lays assault with swiftness to rival winged Mars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯只是个普通人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus stands but mortal man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,凭借我军的装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have yet held privilege of one that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,才可以做到日行千里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could span distant ground within single breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为情报是假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You believe reports false?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为他是用计谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe he lays strategy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.06,0:02:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,目的是迷惑庞培\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to set Pompey to confusion,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,让他跟着斯巴达克斯的影子乱追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}chasing veiled spectre of the man himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,镇压斯巴达克斯是我们的任务 与庞培无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were charged with bringing spartacus to heel, not Pompey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果让色雷斯人跑到山的那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the Thracian slips beyond the mountain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,败者之名就会落到我们头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}burden of defeat shall rest upon our shoulders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那些在战争中死去的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And those that have given life towards campaign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,提比略牺牲的那个叛贼营地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was nothing save cooling embers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,已经人去营空 只剩熄灭的篝火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the rebel camp where Tiberius met his end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.21,0:03:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经派出斥候去侦察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forward scouts are yet to have set eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的动向了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon Spartacus and his army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,再派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See efforts doubled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我要尽快逼迫色雷斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would press the Thracian upon field of battle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,与我军决战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at soonest opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.23,0:03:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我要亲眼看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And gaze into his eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他的眼里永远失去活力和希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as life and hope forever drain from them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,卢戈 交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lugo. See it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我多少次惊叹于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many times have I marveled at{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你那狂热脑瓜子想出的疯狂计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}mad scheme sprung from fevered mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但跟这次相比都是小巫见大巫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet one you now set forth towers above all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经把庞培引去了北边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have confounded Pompey to the north,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.07,0:03:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但克拉苏还是从南面攻过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet Crassus still advances from the south{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他的兵力远远超过我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with overwhelming advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,希望只能寄托在战场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hope lies only in deciding field of final battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.65,0:03:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你就别空口说大话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You weave barest tether to the promise of such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.99,0:03:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们争取的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will hold long enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,足够让其他人逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the others to slip from grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.16,0:03:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我能在阻击克拉苏一战中帮得上忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And would lend much needed aid in giving Crassus fucking pause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,握住这把剑 就让你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Grip sword. And have it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他们夺走了我的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have taken all from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.91,0:04:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你在即将到来的战斗中还有用武之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will yet serve purpose in coming battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.15,0:04:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,带领那些无法打仗的人上山去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By seeing those who cannot fight to the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,跟纳西尔一起完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Return to task with Nasir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,收拾行装吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and prepare for journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他与行尸走肉无异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man is more dead than living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,却还愿意为你的大业牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet eager to give life to your cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我的大业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,到现在还认为这与你无关吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It does yet not stand your own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想以身殉道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm no martyr upon cross,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,为了让更多人活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that will gladly give my life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,主动献出生命什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so that those more deserving may live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.41,0:05:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那就别急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then take pause,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,道别之前 先安抚你的心吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}see heart attended in advance of parting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,恍若隔世啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems another life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.19,0:05:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我还在和克雷斯拥抱亲吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That I last stood in equal embrace with Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去的太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Much has been taken from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很快我们就会面对罗马的大军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon we will face the legions of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要让他们以血还血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we will return bitter favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You crafted this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把手绑在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will lash hand to grip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这样在杀罗马人的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it is not torn from grasp{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,剑和盾就不会脱离掌握\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if called to split Roman flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能跟他们一起逃到山里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot flee to the mountains with the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,无论命令如何 我都要上场杀敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Despite command, my place is upon field of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,而我要永远陪在你身旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As mine is forever by your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,到时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The hour is upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想离开你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not want to leave your arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor I see you from them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.23,0:07:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,可你必须跟他们一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you must go with the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我必须留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know I must stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你们才能到达阿尔卑斯山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That you may reach the mountains,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,离开共和国 自由地生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}live free of the Republic beyond them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你 活着有什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no life absent your touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前跟我说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You once said to me that the gods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神派我来拯救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}had sent me to save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.19,0:07:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你说错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you were mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.05,0:07:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神派的人是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were the one sent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而我才是需要被拯救的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I in need of saving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等到这场仗打完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you when the battle is end{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I may...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿我们在来生的彼岸相见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then as you wish upon the shores of after life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有奥诺玛默斯的陪伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus, keep me accompany{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等你再回我的怀抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}till I hold you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.27,0:08:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May the gods protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.53,0:08:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,打败克拉苏和他的大军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See Crassus and his legion to their end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,您的招术依旧锐不可当 统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your skills remain keen, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在对阵携雨之使者前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would sharpen them to deadly edge,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.39,0:08:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我要磨炼到锋锐无匹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in advance of facing the Bringer of Rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他的表情很安详\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He appears at peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我熟悉的他不是这样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is false image of the boy I knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.19,0:09:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,永远是眉头紧锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forever of furrowed brow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,苦想深思的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and pressing concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他父亲一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A reflection of his father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不苟言笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}grave of face and disposition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.27,0:09:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他以前不是这样 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was not always so. Was he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:10:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 主人 他以前不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Dominus. He was not always so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.19,0:10:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,岁月磨砺了他 剥夺了单纯的快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The passing of years hardens a man to the simple joys of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,直至磨灭一切 只剩铁石心肠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until all that is left is a thing of stone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,冷酷无情和坚韧不屈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}cold and unforgiving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望事情不是这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish nothing more than journey had set towards different path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.71,0:10:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,再给我讲讲他是怎么死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me again of his passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.59,0:10:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那些围观的叛贼奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rebel crowd were thick of slaves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.57,0:10:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对释放克拉苏之子感到愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}angry for the son of Crassus been set free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个奴隶拿刀冲出人群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One broke from crowd with knife punch ahead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,冲到恺撒和提比略的路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at Caesar and Tiberius way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 杀他的奴隶什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give voice to slave that robbed him of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那人上了年纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man long in years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,主人的标记深深地烙进了肉里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With scars of his master etched upon flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他早点死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that he had been struck from this world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,提比略或许就能活下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so that Tiberius may yet be of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉打搅您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies for intrusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,前方斥候回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have received word from forward scouts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的消息吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他有一小队人往北边去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A clutch of his men sighted to the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.91,0:11:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,传令下去 拔起营寨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give order to break encampment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,全军出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and fall to march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,战争终于要结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}War at last draws to its end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是必然的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As all things must,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不该做的梦 总有醒来的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}born of man and misplaced desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,卫兵会带你回到你该去的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The guards will see you returned to where you belong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,您还没有问过我为什么要背叛您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have not asked yet why I turned from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,答案能使时光倒流吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could answer reverse course of time's passing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,能抚平心中最深的伤痛吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or erase memory of deepest wound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.77,0:11:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但我愿意拿性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I would give life to gaze upon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,换得您的原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}forgiveness in your eyes again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是我造成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For all that I have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再心软了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If but I could be so moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一离开营地 你我就分道而行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once beyond camp, you will divide number and path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你们才能瞒过庞培 有机会进山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Better give chance of reaching mountains absent discovery by Pompey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得如果由你带领我们 机会更大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would count fortune more assured, were you to lead us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.93,0:12:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,必须有人挡住克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus must be given pause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.29,0:12:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你们才有时间逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that you and the others may slip beyond grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会等你 就在山脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will wait for you then, at foot of the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不许你这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I would not have it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我想怎么做 难道不是我的自由吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I not free, to make own choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你总这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you frequently remind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但别拿生命冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet do not hazard life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定我能活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in hopes that I yet cling to my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会在和克拉苏的战斗中死去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will not fall in battle against Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在还能够预知未来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You now hold power to pierce future's uncertain veil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hold but faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,相信这个与众不同的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In a man like no other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.76,0:12:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢你这样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude. For your words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你的陪伴带给我的安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And for what comfort your presence has given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别死在罗马狗手里 贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not fall to the Romans, you well, cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.05,0:13:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,老娘操翻他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fuck them all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,再来找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.65,0:13:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你的任务搞清楚了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are clear of purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,再清楚不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never more so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.37,0:13:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,纳西尔和我不跟他们一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet Nasir and I shall not be among those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,往阿尔卑斯山走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}striking towards mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经说好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have broken words towards subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.51,0:13:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能战斗…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You cannot fight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但他找到了方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has yet found way,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是我亲手帮的忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}forged by loving hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.33,0:13:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,大战在即 休想叫我袖手旁观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not ask my own to lay idle in coming battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.15,0:13:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看见很多兄弟死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have born witness to the fall of many I have called brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,当年和我一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are the last yet living{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大闹巴蒂塔斯家的兄弟 只有你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that stood with me when Batiatus' ludus was laid to ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You honor me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,能和你在决战中再次并肩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by standing again at my side in final conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.13,0:14:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们准备好出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are ready to journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.16,0:14:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们分别的时候到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The time of our parting has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 当我们面对克拉苏的大军时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Know that you will be heavy upon thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最挂念的就是你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when we face Crassus and his legions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.41,0:14:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many of us will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,无论什么谋略和计策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There remains strategy nor deception{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,都已无法改变这一命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that can bend course of inevitable fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但请记住 我们的热血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet know that our blood...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,换来的是宝贵的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shall purchase needed opportunity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好让你们翻山而去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for you to gain mountain paths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,离开罗马的尖牙利爪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beyond snapping jaws of Rome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.19,0:15:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,离开带给我们死亡和不幸的血盆大口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that have plagued us with death... ...and misery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.49,0:15:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就此分别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Part ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,自由生活吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And live free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.07,0:15:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你所做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude. For all you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude. Gratitude, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude. Gratitude Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,愿诸神护佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May the gods bless you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,愿诸神护佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May the gods bless you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.59,0:15:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有罗马探子看到我们往山谷南面去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roman scouts have laid eyes upon us to the south of the valley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们佩戴的是什么徽章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What markings did they bear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,胸前是可怕的公牛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fearsome bull upon chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是克拉苏的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,总算是上钩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fucking bait is seized upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:15:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快出发 不要回头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Set upon path, and do not turn from it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我会祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall lend prayer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,希望克拉苏灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Toward the end of Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯凯旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the triumph of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经受够了眼泪和道别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have had my fill of words and tearful farewells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在要的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I desire blood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人的鲜血和惨叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and cries of our enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们便去要来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us make it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,弩炮准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Balistae ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没有命令不许妄动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not engage unless given command!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.78,0:17:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,预备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.25,0:17:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.61,0:17:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是来挑衅的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not seek quarrel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.65,0:17:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,只是代克拉苏统帅传达口信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only to deliver message from Imperator Crassus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有话快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Break words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.56,0:17:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果说的是废话 别怪我不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And pray to your gods I find them of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,此情此景你可曾见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you ever witnessed such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,多少颗跳动的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So many hearts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.53,0:18:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,即将不可避免地迎接死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}beating towards inevitable end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,为何叫我过来 克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you call me here, Crassus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The same reason you came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.75,0:18:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,出于好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Curiosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那你满意了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well has it been satisfying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这对冤家纠缠了许久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've vexed each other for many months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.29,0:18:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,彼此都遭受了巨大的伤痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Both suffering grievous wound upon effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.71,0:18:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,却从来没有机会说两句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet have never broken single word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,说与不说又有什么区别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are none that would hold difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是无论如何 我还是想跟你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I would stil l have them regardless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.05,0:19:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.85,0:19:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,服从命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall to command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.46,0:19:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,结果显而易见 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a thing known, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你不可能赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That you cannot win this conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很多罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A sentiment shared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.85,0:19:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,都有过同样的想法 最后死于我的剑下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By all the Romans I have killed who held such belief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子就是其中之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My son among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 统帅大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies Imperator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对于那个杀了克雷斯的罗马战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot give voice to regret of passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不能表达哀悼之情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the soldier that robbed Crixus of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,高卢人死在战场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Gaul died upon field of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.36,0:20:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,提比略却不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An honor denied Tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.11,0:20:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是我这样安排的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not as I had commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜那个被你儿子虐待过的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet the woman had been rudely treated by his hands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一心想要复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and her own claimed vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我也深切地体会到丧子之痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As mine are so moved in memory of my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,而你对你妻子的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yours towards wife no longer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不要以为我们的伤痛可以相提并论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not think to place your loss upon equal footing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你儿子为共和国而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your son took up arms for the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,正是共和国夺走了我无辜的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The same one that saw my innocent wife torn from grasp{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,将她贬为奴隶 害她死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and condemned to slavery and death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.93,0:20:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在你还要垂死挣扎 害千万人送死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now you would lead thousands to join her in futile attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我那些兄弟姐妹的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever happens to my people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,都是自己选择的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it happens because we choose for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们自己决定命运 不由你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We decide our fates. Not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不由罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.19,0:20:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,也不由天上的诸神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not even the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:21:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们选择的不过是灭亡的时间和地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You choose but time and place of journey's end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.61,0:21:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,死于剑下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Better to fall by the sword{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.29,0:21:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好过死在主人的鞭下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than by the master's lash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.03,0:21:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这能抚平你的伤痛吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And will it balm festering wound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果携雨之使者再次创造奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the Bringer of Rain heralds miracle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,击败克拉苏和他的军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and defeats Crassus and his legions,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他会不会离开共和国呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will he withdraw from the Republic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,为他所带来的公正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Content that he's brought those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.17,0:21:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,而感到心满意足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who so injured him to justice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没有公正可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世上没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not in this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也有意见一致的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing we agree upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,下一次见面 我必定要你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When we again meet, I will kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 你只能试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. You are going to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:22:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是自由人的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is all a free man can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.81,0:22:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你可不能相信斯巴达克斯的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You cannot place trust in the words of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.45,0:22:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他有什么理由在这件事情上骗我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What reason would he have to twist tongue upon subject?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不会假装知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not pretend to know lay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,奴隶的脑子在想什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of a savage's fucking thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,杀死提比略的凶手到底是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What hand struck Tiberius from this life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了 是个上了年纪的男人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One belonging to a man long in years, as I have said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.61,0:22:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯说是个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus spoke of a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,而且是为了复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Moved by vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.11,0:22:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他无非是企图用谎言离间我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He but attempts to turn us against each other with plotted lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.63,0:22:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这话若有半分虚假 我决不轻饶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The threat of ruin carries upon such deceit, if so embraced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只有道出真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet only in the breaking of truth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.26,0:22:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,才有可能得到原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}swells hope of forgiveness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.88,0:23:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对提比略下手的人是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was my hand that moved against Tiberius,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是我亲手杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and saw him from this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.14,0:23:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我待你太残酷吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was my touch so cruel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,以至于你杀死我高贵的儿子 来伤透我的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That you would strike at heart through noble son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.07,0:23:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,趁你的喉咙还没有断掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}While you yet have throat to give voice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你岂能怪罪受害者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You place blame upon victim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你那臭小子真是高贵 竟然强奸了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your "Noble" Fucking son forced himself inside her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.51,0:23:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他恶行累累 罪有应得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of many acts that lead to deserved fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More lies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.99,0:23:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is the truth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.33,0:23:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,十一抽杀刑毕后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His love for you turned to hate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.01,0:23:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,提比略对您由爱转恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the wake of the decimation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.00,0:23:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他用唯一可行的方式报复了您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he struck at you the only way he could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.46,0:23:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道只有这样才能伤您最深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One he knew would inflict deepest wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.25,0:23:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不早跟我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you not tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.42,0:23:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我在米利亚峰曾想说出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I made attempt, upon Melia Ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.01,0:23:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他毕竟是我心爱的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no misstep that would see father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.40,0:24:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,无论犯下什么错 都是可以原谅的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}withhold forgiveness from treasured son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.55,0:24:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不想再给你增添无谓的痛苦 马科斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We did not wish to cause you further pain absent reason, Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.84,0:24:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才没有说出真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cause of withholding truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.42,0:24:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,下去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.37,0:24:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有其父必有其子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A son is but reflection of the father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我是这样的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this how I stand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.15,0:24:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,扭曲而怪异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Twisted and grotesque?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.80,0:24:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,您从来没有变过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand as you always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.49,0:24:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,正直无私 恪尽职守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A good man. That does what he must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.51,0:25:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.06,0:25:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.71,0:25:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,让你受了这么多苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies for all you've suffered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.64,0:25:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等剿灭斯巴达克斯 一切都会结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Know that it shall end when Spartacus falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.20,0:25:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,战争中的种种不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And unfortunate events of war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.11,0:25:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,必将烟消云散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}trod path of distant memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.38,0:25:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,(卡拉布利亚)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.58,0:25:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,(色雷斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.67,0:26:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,担子不轻啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is heavy burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.72,0:26:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,眼看战争接近尾声 掂量代价有多沉重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gaze at war's end. And weigh bitter cost of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.65,0:26:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信我们能打败克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do not believe that we can defeat Crassus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.05,0:26:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你总能变不可能为可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are forever conjuring the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.58,0:26:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这最后一把我也不会赌别人赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would not wager against you in final gambit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.02,0:26:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但局势不太乐观啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet odds are not of a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 的确不乐观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. They are not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.49,0:26:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我本打算请你喝一杯快活快活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would offer drink to lift spirits,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.54,0:26:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但最近我已经戒了酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I have turned from it of late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.37,0:26:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我注意到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing not escaping notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.77,0:26:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,当那颗纯洁的心占据我的身心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I too turned from wild pursuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.40,0:26:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不再放荡不羁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When possessed by purest heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.69,0:26:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说你的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak of your wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.17,0:26:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们第一次相拥而睡时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When we first lay together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.46,0:26:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她说诸神托梦给她 以传达神谕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she told of how the gods delivered oracle in her dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.92,0:27:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,预言我不会再爱上别的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And foretold that I would never love another woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.87,0:27:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,预言成真了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did prophecy hold true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.50,0:27:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我在别人那里找到过安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I found comfort in others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但心中总有空虚 永远无法填满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet there's an emptiness that can never be filled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那里原是心脏跳动的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A void left where heart once beat,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.02,0:27:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在苏拉离开我的时候掏空了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when Sura was taken from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.24,0:27:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾经问过我胜利该如何定义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You once questioned how victory can be defined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.92,0:27:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为罗马人的死就是胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought answer held in Roman deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.78,0:27:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不这么想了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A position no longer taken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,生命 而不是罗马人的死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Life is what defines it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.08,0:27:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,定义了何为胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not the death of Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.24,0:27:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我们的命 也不是兄弟们的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor ours, nor those that follow us into battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.33,0:27:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,而是希贝儿的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the life of Sibyl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.03,0:27:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,莱塔的命 那对母子的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of Laeta, the mother and her child,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.14,0:27:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,还有许许多多人的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so many others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是苏拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are all Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.46,0:27:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要他们活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would see them live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.48,0:27:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的大业 即便是我也愿意接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A cause even I can embrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.57,0:28:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们要其他人逃脱克拉苏的魔掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we are to give the others any chance against Crassus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.55,0:28:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你仅仅接受是不够的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you must do more than embrace it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.29,0:28:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须领导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.48,0:28:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别老调重弹了 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An old argument, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.01,0:28:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,现在必须说清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that must now stand settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.81,0:28:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你不能负起应有的责任 我是做不来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot do this without you assuming rightful position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.60,0:28:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你能扛起这副担子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that there is none more deserving of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.56,0:28:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would you have me do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.34,0:28:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.15,0:28:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,士兵都就位了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The men stand ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.71,0:28:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They do, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.42,0:28:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.24,0:28:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,为你的忠诚效力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For loyal service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.77,0:28:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯是傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus stands the fool,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.43,0:29:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,带这么点人对抗我们的大军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to face our legions with so few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.08,0:29:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他这人一言难以蔽之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has proven himself many things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.55,0:29:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但傻瓜一词不在其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fool not among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.25,0:29:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们真是人山人海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They stand an ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.86,0:29:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就和克雷斯被吞没时一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As when Crixus was swept from the shores of the living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.01,0:29:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是给我们提供机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They but offer opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.98,0:29:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好让我们畅游在罗马人的血海之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To swim in a sea of Roman blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.03,0:29:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕的不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Great and unfortunate things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.14,0:29:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你这话是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What meaning do words carry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.20,0:30:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是警告 是一位心爱的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A warning, given voice by loving wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.63,0:30:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对即将战死的丈夫说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To a man who no longer exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.47,0:30:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏即将下令开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon Crassus will give command!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.95,0:30:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要与他的大军一决雌雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we shall face his legions in open battle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们面对的是强大的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We stand in the shadow of greater might!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.34,0:30:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们所代表的共和国的阴影笼罩着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As their Republic cast across the lives of every man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.86,0:30:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,每一个男人 女人和孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}every woman... And every child...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.69,0:30:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,要我们在阴影中苟且偷生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}condemned to the darkness of slavery!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.58,0:30:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们害我们受苦受难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forced to toil and suffer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.17,0:30:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好让那些达官贵人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so that those of coin and position{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.29,0:30:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,过上穷奢极欲的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}can see their fortunes grow beyond need or purpose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.60,0:30:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来告诉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us teach them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.51,0:31:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,人人生而平等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that all who draw breath are of equal worth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.49,0:31:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那些企图践踏个人意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that those that seek to place heel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.99,0:31:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,镇压人民的无知权贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon the throat of liberty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.88,0:31:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,必将倒在自由的怒吼声中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will fall to the cry of freedom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.24,0:31:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,此战要斩尽杀绝 不可心慈手软\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No wounded enemy is to be blessed with merciful passing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.51,0:31:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀鸡儆猴 让共和国的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would make example of all those who dare raise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.00,0:31:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,引以为戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hand against the glory of Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.41,0:31:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,投石器和弩炮准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raise ballistae and catapults.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.68,0:31:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,装弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.94,0:31:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,点火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ignite!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.69,0:31:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,准备 放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready! Release!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.64,0:32:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,吹进军号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sound advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.75,0:32:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一举清缴叛贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And see Rebellion distant memory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.08,0:32:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.54,0:32:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.06,0:32:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,原地待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.09,0:32:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.33,0:32:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.53,0:32:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.22,0:33:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,弓箭手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Archers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.53,0:33:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.32,0:33:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这野蛮人真是诡计多端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The savage yet proves resourceful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.52,0:33:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他不过是螳臂当车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He but delays coming tide with grains of sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.79,0:33:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,发号令 摆龟甲阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give signal to form testudo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.76,0:33:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们果然中计了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They fall to predicted maneuver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.43,0:33:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那就打他们个措手不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us show them one unexpected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.39,0:33:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.04,0:34:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,准备投石器和弩炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raise command for ballistae and catapults!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.07,0:34:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,连我军将士一起杀吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would rain death upon our own men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.70,0:34:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打赢这场仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would end this fucking war!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.89,0:34:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别停下脚步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not turn from advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.56,0:34:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,往前冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Press forward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.04,0:35:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我操你娘
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.27,0:35:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还是统帅棋高一着 奴隶大军完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The slaves fall to superior strategy and tactic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.19,0:35:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也打死了不少罗马士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As do Romans beneath our command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.20,0:35:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不幸的损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An unfortunate loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.34,0:35:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不过完全可以接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet one gladly accepted,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.12,0:35:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是为了剿灭斯巴达克斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to bring Spartacus to his end{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.32,0:35:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,骑兵来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Riders approaching!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.41,0:35:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,向后转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}About face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.87,0:35:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,调转弩炮的方向 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turn ballistae! Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.53,0:36:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你去那边 保护左翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You there! Defend the left flank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.53,0:36:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒 快去后方领军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar! Take command of rear position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.57,0:36:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,千万不可乱了阵脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not let them fall to confusion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.34,0:36:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must withdraw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.57,0:36:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不 撤退就正中他下怀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! That is what he expects!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.67,0:36:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,吹号角 前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sound horn and advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.43,0:36:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯特斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Castus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.29,0:36:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我是你该有多好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that I had been you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.09,0:36:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕就一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for but a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.64,0:37:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.23,0:37:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你这路要撑住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shore your flank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.40,0:37:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他们包围我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not let them close upon us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.74,0:37:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,纳西尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nasir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.59,0:37:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅 支援甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia! Aid Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.07,0:37:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.61,0:37:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.11,0:37:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.66,0:38:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.96,0:38:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,保护统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Protect the Imperator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.70,0:38:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.48,0:38:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真是光荣的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a glorious day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,能杀这么多罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To have so many Romans to kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.82,0:38:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只有杀了那个人才有意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is but one life that holds meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.73,0:38:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你负责战场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Draw attention upon field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.17,0:38:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我去讨命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall claim it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.11,0:38:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,保持阵型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold the line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.64,0:38:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,快去拿双耳罐 朝他们扔过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seize amphoras and see them to purpose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.45,0:39:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.85,0:39:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快找医官来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send for the medicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.04,0:39:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要疗伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need no soothing balm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.69,0:39:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回战场杀叛贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only to return to field with rebel blood hot upon face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.58,0:39:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,您可要长远考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not place yourself at further risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.24,0:39:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果您倒下了 斯巴达克斯就占据上风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you fall, spartacus would gain advantage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.87,0:39:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就想跟你真刀真枪干一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have longed to meet you in true contest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.08,0:39:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我也早就想把你该死的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I have longed to see your head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.62,0:39:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,给砍下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}parted from fucking neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.78,0:40:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,萨克莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Saxa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.32,0:41:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于又
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.62,0:41:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,躺在你怀里了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.43,0:41:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我承诺过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I made promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.84,0:41:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,下一次见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That time next we met...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.56,0:41:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我必取你性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.64,0:41:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.35,0:41:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看你有没有这本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And attempt to take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.66,0:41:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,列阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Formation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.58,0:42:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这剑不属于你 奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This does not belong to you, slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.00,0:42:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.47,0:43:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,轮换\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rotate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.94,0:43:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.57,0:46:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,且慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.24,0:46:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望你生为罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that you had been born a Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.06,0:46:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,为我效力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And had stood beside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.05,0:46:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,命运待我不薄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bless the fates...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.89,0:46:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没有如你所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that it was not so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.63,0:48:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.25,0:48:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,给我剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give me a sword...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.39,0:48:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.07,0:48:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我 夺回山丘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall by my side and retake hill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.83,0:48:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,扫荡附近的山丘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweep surrounding hills!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.07,0:48:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.24,0:48:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神又帮了斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods once more aid Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.83,0:49:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,让他逃出我们的手心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in slipping from fucking grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.91,0:49:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他遍体鳞伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He weeps from a thousand wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.97,0:49:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就算还没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if heart yet beats,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.64,0:49:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也活不了多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it shall cease at briefest passing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.77,0:49:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还有很多跟随他造反的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are many who have followed mad cause{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.25,0:49:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没有断气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that still cling to fading life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.31,0:49:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那就在亚壁古道杀鸡儆猴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See them to promised example upon Appian Way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.51,0:49:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要所有胆敢反抗罗马的奴隶都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And let all slaves, upon road to Mother Rome know reward{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.65,0:49:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,与主人作对是什么下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for turning hand against master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.44,0:50:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,死得真不光彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ignoble end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.83,0:50:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对于昔日竞技场的传奇战神而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For a legend that once stood a god of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.59,0:50:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,传奇不过是有血有肉的美梦而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Legends are but bone and meat of dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.41,0:50:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在现实的烈日下唯有腐烂一途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rotting in the harsh sun of reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.32,0:50:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真不忍心看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is hard sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.84,0:50:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经深受宠爱的人也在受刑之列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To see one so loved among the damned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.19,0:50:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,众所周知她也是叛贼的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was known to be of the rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.21,0:50:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我有心饶恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have forgiven reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.82,0:50:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet do what I must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.26,0:51:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,庞培\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pompey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.19,0:51:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,看到老朋友安然无恙 真是谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praise the gods to find you well old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.54,0:51:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我还担心我在北边剿匪时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd feared that Spartacus and his Rebels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.39,0:51:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯及其叛众把你给灭了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}had overrun you before I routed him in the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.99,0:51:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,北边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The north?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.36,0:51:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他率军剿灭了逃往山中的叛贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He came upon rebel army attempting to gain the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.05,0:51:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,消息已经送往罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dispatch has already been sent to Rome,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.61,0:51:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,认定庞培有功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}naming Pompey victor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.34,0:51:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,剿灭了你没能镇压的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against enemy you could not quell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.44,0:51:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,功劳不是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You claim false laurels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.55,0:51:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus was defeated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.76,0:51:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在北边覆没 多亏了勇猛的庞培\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the north. By valiant Pompey,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.03,0:51:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,伊伯利亚的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hero of Hispania.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.35,0:51:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,承蒙夸赞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You honor me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.48,0:51:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我夸赞的是罗马的胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but honor Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.90,0:51:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,各位同心协力 罗马必能繁荣昌盛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And those of like mind, that would see it flourish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.32,0:51:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄所见略同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we are one in such regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.81,0:51:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为你接风洗尘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us break meal on your return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.05,0:51:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,费了千辛万苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After all that we have suffered,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.47,0:52:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你就让庞培抢走了胜利果实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you allow Pompey to snatch triumph from deserving hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.69,0:52:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们表态支持 便可以拉拢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Supporting claim he will be made ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.93,0:52:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将成为强大的三巨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall stand fearsome triumvirate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.04,0:52:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,强大到足以影响历史的进程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with means to bend the course of history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.07,0:52:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是说未来的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You forever speak of the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.98,0:52:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,过去已经无法改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The past cannot be altered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.18,0:52:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,当下只有遗憾与损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The present holds but regret and loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.43,0:52:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,唯有未来 可以抚慰人心的伤痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is only in the days to come that a man may find solace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.70,0:52:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,让回忆烟消云散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When memory fades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.86,0:53:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯 甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus! Gannicus! Gannicus!...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.62,0:53:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He yet lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.08,0:53:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到阿尔卑斯山了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've gained the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.95,0:54:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在等你 说好了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We waited for you, as promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.78,0:54:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,都没事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.95,0:54:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,庞培袭击了另一路人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pompey set upon other half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.75,0:54:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many were lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.58,0:54:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须带他上山了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must see him to mountain path,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.64,0:54:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我们也会被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before we too are discovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.39,0:54:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.41,0:54:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我要休息一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would rest awhile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.46,0:54:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We cannot stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.77,0:54:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们当然不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, you cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.06,0:54:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不能跟你们走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor can I follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.86,0:54:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus... Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.16,0:55:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.13,0:55:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is not my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.32,0:55:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于能再一次听见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall finally hear it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.60,0:55:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,心爱的妻子呼唤我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Given voice by loving wife...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.15,0:55:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,发出渴望已久的问候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in greeting longed for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.82,0:55:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不要流泪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not shed tear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.69,0:55:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没有比这更伟大的胜利了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no greater victory...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.41,0:55:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,死的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than to fall from this world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.66,0:55:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是自由之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a free man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.21,0:57:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,终有一日 罗马将不复存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One day Rome shall fade and crumble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.38,0:57:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但所有追求自由的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you shall always be remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.91,0:57:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,都将永远把你铭记于心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the hearts of all who yearn for freedom.{\r}
